1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:04,200
Good evening and welcome to the timetable meeting.

2
00:00:04,200 --> 00:00:09,800
Tonight we look at the new winter timetable for the coast line.

3
00:00:09,800 --> 00:00:15,360
The first train now leaves at 5:40, twenty minutes earlier than before.

4
00:00:15,360 --> 00:00:19,040
The last train still leaves at 11:15.

5
00:30:05,520 --> 00:30:11,000
Some of you asked about the connection to the ferry.

6
00:30:11,000 --> 00:30:16,480
The bus waits at the station for ten minutes.

7
00:59:58,500 --> 01:00:03,240
Change at Bay Junction -> then take the bus to the pier.

8
01:00:03,240 --> 01:00:09,000
Thank you all for coming tonight.
